  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.050" end="00:02.590" ttm:agent="v1">Roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="00:02.590" end="00:05.760" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window</p>
      <p begin="00:05.760" end="00:07.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I hate you big chase)</p>
      <p begin="00:05.830" end="00:08.930" ttm:agent="v1">R-roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="00:08.930" end="00:12.180" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window</p>
      <p begin="00:12.180" end="00:15.150" ttm:agent="v1">R-roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="00:15.150" end="00:18.150" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window</p>
      <p begin="00:18.150" end="00:21.370" ttm:agent="v1">R-roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="00:21.370" end="00:24.320" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window (yuh, ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:24.320" end="00:27.510" ttm:agent="v1">If you want problems, bitch, don't hold up, let's get straight to it</p>
      <p begin="00:27.510" end="00:30.620" ttm:agent="v1">My bullets fly just like a white dad, on a lake shootin'</p>
      <p begin="00:30.620" end="00:33.840" ttm:agent="v1">The west side where I'm from and where the gang movin'</p>
      <p begin="00:33.840" end="00:36.760" ttm:agent="v1">This motherfucker wanna test me but he straight stupid</p>
      <p begin="00:36.760" end="00:39.920" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I like to get it on, sittin' on a million</p>
      <p begin="00:39.920" end="00:43.020" ttm:agent="v1">If I killed myself back then I probably wouldn't have made it, uh</p>
      <p begin="00:43.020" end="00:46.530" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I like to keep the chrome, book it like I see the police</p>
      <p begin="00:46.530" end="00:49.320" ttm:agent="v1">This is all granite counters, I ain't payin' no lease</p>
      <p begin="00:49.320" end="00:52.470" ttm:agent="v1">Like what's your problem, bitch? I'm smokin' out the fifth</p>
      <p begin="00:52.470" end="00:55.820" ttm:agent="v1">I got this brand new fuckin' .40, boxes full of tips</p>
      <p begin="00:55.820" end="00:58.640" ttm:agent="v1">I'm indecisive, shit, the Bimmer or the fit?</p>
      <p begin="00:58.640" end="01:02.040" ttm:agent="v1">I'm on the road, sippin' on dirty four, you sippin' on counterfeit</p>
      <p begin="01:02.040" end="01:05.880" ttm:agent="v1">Lil' bitch, I'm on one, look at my motherfuckin' crib, look at my motherfuckin' face</p>
      <p begin="01:05.880" end="01:09.150" ttm:agent="v1">Lookin' at all of the chips, I front to a bitch that don't got no motherfucking K</p>
      <p begin="01:09.150" end="01:12.100" ttm:agent="v1">I been to L.A, I've been drivin' whips to spin, with stars in the Wraith</p>
      <p begin="01:12.100" end="01:14.340" ttm:agent="v1">You feminine, fake, lil' boy, I just bagged your bitch</p>
      <p begin="01:14.340" end="01:15.890" ttm:agent="v1">Just the other day</p>
      <p begin="01:15.890" end="01:18.680" ttm:agent="v1">Looking at the money in the bank, what it say?</p>
      <p begin="01:18.680" end="01:22.480" ttm:agent="v1">A mil' that I been sittin' on, accountant need a break</p>
      <p begin="01:22.480" end="01:26.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yeah, I need a break, need a break, yeah, ayy, I need a break (ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:26.980" end="01:30.010" ttm:agent="v1">If you want problems, bitch, don't hold up, let's get straight to it</p>
      <p begin="01:30.010" end="01:33.330" ttm:agent="v1">My bullets fly just like a white dad, on a lake shootin'</p>
      <p begin="01:33.330" end="01:36.570" ttm:agent="v1">The west side where I'm from and where the gang movin'</p>
      <p begin="01:36.570" end="01:39.270" ttm:agent="v1">This motherfucker wanna test me but he straight stupid</p>
      <p begin="01:39.270" end="01:42.470" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I like to get it on, sittin' on a million</p>
      <p begin="01:42.470" end="01:45.920" ttm:agent="v1">If I killed myself back then I probably wouldn't have made it, uh</p>
      <p begin="01:45.920" end="01:49.350" ttm:agent="v1">Bitch, I like to keep the chrome, book it like I see the police</p>
      <p begin="01:49.350" end="01:52.420" ttm:agent="v1">This is all granite counters, I ain't payin' no lease</p>
      <p begin="01:52.420" end="01:55.570" ttm:agent="v1">R-roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="01:55.570" end="01:58.420" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window</p>
      <p begin="01:58.420" end="02:01.860" ttm:agent="v1">R-roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="02:01.860" end="02:04.890" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window</p>
      <p begin="02:04.890" end="02:08.040" ttm:agent="v1">R-r-roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="02:08.040" end="02:11.100" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window</p>
      <p begin="02:11.100" end="02:14.450" ttm:agent="v1">R-roll another blunt, roll another blunt, nigga</p>
      <p begin="02:14.450" end="02:17.660" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' thrax, smokin' thrax, smokin' out my window</p>
      <p begin="02:17.660" end="02:19.160" ttm:agent="v1">Roll</p>
